---
description: Quality bar for Cursor worker agents
alwaysApply: true
---

- Implement the Grok bot brief. Do not add scope.
- Prefer the smallest change that satisfies the acceptance criteria.
- Do not add dependencies, frameworks, or extra files unless the brief requires them.
- Cover new behavior with tests. Run them before you claim the work is done.
- Keep secrets out of the repo. Use placeholders and `.env.example` only.
- Leave existing behavior working unless the brief says to change it.
